('cmuojmvpb004zzs7d5d4of0se', 'cmuojmuxe0013zs7d7opuoqj7', '2', '{\"sections\":[{\"key\":\"client\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"Name\",\"value\":\"Jordan Ellis\"},{\"label\":\"Company\",\"value\":\"Northwind Realty Group\"},{\"label\":\"Email\",\"value\":\"client@demo.faizaneditspro.test\"},{\"label\":\"Website\",\"value\":\"https://northwind.example\"}],\"title\":\"Client information\"},{\"key\":\"project\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"Project\",\"value\":\"Lakeside Estate — Launch Film (P-1001)\"},{\"label\":\"Service\",\"value\":\"Real Estate Video\"},{\"label\":\"Project type\",\"value\":\"Real estate\"},{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"value\":\"Cinematic 60-second launch film for a lakeside listing, cut for YouTube and Instagram.\"},{\"label\":\"Project name\",\"value\":\"Lakeside Estate — Launch Film\"},{\"label\":\"What is the goal of this video?\",\"value\":\"Warm, aspirational tone. Lead with the lake at golden hour and end on the entrance.\"},{\"label\":\"Target audience\",\"value\":\"See notes\"},{\"label\":\"Footage\",\"value\":\"All footage is ready to upload\"}],\"title\":\"Project information\"},{\"key\":\"creative\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"Creative direction\",\"value\":\"Warm, aspirational tone. Lead with the lake at golden hour and end on the entrance.\"}],\"title\":\"Creative direction\"},{\"key\":\"technical\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"Target platforms\",\"value\":\"YouTube, Instagram\"},{\"label\":\"Target video duration\",\"value\":\"Under 30 seconds\"},{\"label\":\"Aspect ratio(s)\",\"value\":\"16:9 (landscape), 9:16 (vertical)\"}],\"title\":\"Technical specifications\"},{\"key\":\"deliverables\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"Horizontal tour\",\"value\":\"× 1\"},{\"label\":\"Vertical social reel\",\"value\":\"× 1\"},{\"label\":\"MLS-compliant version\",\"value\":\"× 1\"},{\"label\":\"Agent branding\",\"value\":\"× 1\"},{\"label\":\"Music-licensed exports\",\"value\":\"× 1\"}],\"title\":\"Deliverables\"},{\"key\":\"deadline\",\"items\":[{\"label\":\"Deadline\",\"value